                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-04-28"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">April 28,
                    1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Conger reports the release and arrival at Chefoo to-day of the Japanese
